 {"unit"      {:full 730  :fast 1264 :how "the Rust arm only (the arms are the same laws in four languages); without corpus/ the six laws that read real files from it are skipped by name, loudly; EMON_FAST_HOSTS adds go/java/csharp when corpus/ is there. The preamble (table and golden checks) runs as in the gate. FULL is the Rust arm alone: all four arms are longer"}
